OL,3,GNEWSAMan's warning over symptoms of leg
OL,4,Acondition
OL,5,
OL,6,F"No-one wants to lose their leg but
OL,7,Fthat's the reality of what could
OL,8,Fhappen," says Paul Hardy, who was
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with peripheral arterial
OL,10,Fdisease (PAD) four years ago.
OL,12,FHe underwent angioplasty procedures to
OL,13,Fkeep blood flowing to his legs to save
OL,14,Fthem from amputation, and manages the
OL,15,Fdisease - caused by the narrowing or
OL,16,Fblockage of arteries in the legs - with
OL,17,Fmedication and exercise.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
