OL,3,GNEWSAMan's warning over symptoms of leg
OL,4,Acondition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 62-year-old from Leicester is now
OL,7,Fpart of a campaign urging people not to
OL,8,Fignore warning signs of PAD, which
OL,9,Finclude foot pain while resting, and
OL,10,Ffoot and leg ulcers that do not heal.
OL,12,FThe "Are Your Legs Killing You?"
OL,13,Fcampaign was launched by the University
OL,14,Fof Leicester on Monday and will run
OL,15,Fover six weeks.
